# .build/ holds internal working documents: the cut-over runbook, both proofread
# punch lists, the translation guides and translation-status.json. They are
# readable English prose about unpublished work and have no business being
# served at https://www.marketingpro-agency.com/.build/cutover.md
.build/

# Source images, ~28 MB. Gitignored today, so this is a second line of defence
# in case a .gitignore merge ever loses that rule.
originals/

# Repo metadata
.git/
.gitattributes
.gitignore
